WEBVTT

00:02.190 --> 00:05.399
Hey, don't you think we're a bit far out?

00:05.400 --> 00:08.699
No point in searching
if we're not spread out.

00:08.700 --> 00:11.489
Why did I get stuck with you?

00:11.490 --> 00:15.829
Wait, Marlo... You just wanted
alone time with me, didn't you?

00:15.830 --> 00:20.169
Hitch... I'm sorry, but you're
not my first choice either.

00:20.170 --> 00:23.419
Oh, is that right? Well, good for you.

00:23.420 --> 00:26.089
But, don't you think it's odd?

00:26.090 --> 00:30.139
Why would the Scouts kill
a civilian and run for the hills?

00:30.140 --> 00:31.883
They're the same group
that's always risking

00:31.908 --> 00:35.979
their lives for the
sake of humanity.

00:35.980 --> 00:39.439
I can't believe you... Did you forget?

00:39.440 --> 00:42.269
Remember what they did
to Stohess District?

00:42.270 --> 00:45.149
How they turned it into a battlefield?

00:45.150 --> 00:48.410
All those corpses we had to carry?

00:49.410 --> 00:52.030
And how Annie's still missing?

00:53.410 --> 00:57.919
All of her junk is still in
my room... and it's annoying.

00:57.920 --> 01:03.959
But they also uncovered that Titan in
hiding and somehow managed to capture it.

01:03.960 --> 01:07.549
You think any other
regiment could do that?

01:07.550 --> 01:11.259
If the Scouts get disbanded
like this, humanity can't...

01:11.260 --> 01:12.430
Quiet.

01:13.600 --> 01:15.270
I hear water.

01:19.440 --> 01:20.520
Don't move!

01:23.230 --> 01:25.190
Slowly turn this way.

01:28.450 --> 01:30.490
You must be a scout.

01:32.450 --> 01:35.449
Just like that... Not a word.

01:35.450 --> 01:38.160
Now listen to me and do as I...

01:40.210 --> 01:44.590
That's right... Hand over your
guns to the one in front.

01:50.840 --> 01:52.800
And not a word, right?

03:22.770 --> 03:27.770
"Trust"

03:28.150 --> 03:31.440
"Capital Mitras"

03:38.950 --> 03:42.250
Sorry to keep you waiting, Erwin.

03:43.790 --> 03:47.880
I know it's sudden, but let's get
the interrogation over with.

03:50.800 --> 03:56.509
So, it's unmistakable that the Scout
Regiment murdered a civilian?

03:56.510 --> 03:58.799
Judging by the evidence, at least.

03:58.800 --> 04:03.139
Having said that, we can't say
for sure at the time being.

04:03.140 --> 04:06.559
Are you saying the Interior Police are
responsible for issuing the search...?

04:06.560 --> 04:08.609
Hey, Peaure!

04:08.610 --> 04:13.189
Sorry about him, Commander Dawk.
He's still a rookie, through and through.

04:13.190 --> 04:16.529
He doesn't know how we
do things within the walls.

04:16.530 --> 04:20.699
Don't you worry about the Interior Police.
We won't write anything about 'em.

04:20.700 --> 04:23.869
That goes for their new ODM gear, too.

04:23.870 --> 04:26.080
I appreciate it, Roy.

04:27.330 --> 04:30.289
Their new ODM gear...

04:30.290 --> 04:35.049
That buckshot is useless against Titans,
but it's perfect for killing people.

04:35.050 --> 04:38.639
It's a weapon practically made
for killing the Scouts...

04:38.640 --> 04:42.719
Plus, its existence being hidden
even from us means...

04:42.720 --> 04:45.764
...sooner or later, we might
find ourselves staring down

04:45.789 --> 04:48.849
their muzzles all the same.

04:48.850 --> 04:53.650
Anyways, we should hear a report
from them soon, so be patient.

04:56.740 --> 04:59.320
Wait up, you fat-ass!

05:06.410 --> 05:09.710
You idiot! That way's a dead end!

05:10.960 --> 05:12.040
Shit!

05:20.720 --> 05:22.849
Shit, he's gone!

05:22.850 --> 05:25.019
Find him! Find him!

05:25.020 --> 05:26.520
Don't let 'em escape!

05:31.900 --> 05:34.779
You're the son of Boss Reeves, right?

05:34.780 --> 05:36.110
What's your name?

05:37.780 --> 05:39.449
Flegel.

05:39.450 --> 05:41.239
Nice to meet you, Flegel.

05:41.240 --> 05:43.159
I'm Hange Zoe.

05:43.160 --> 05:46.579
The thing is, if the Military
Police is after you,

05:46.580 --> 05:50.249
that must mean you know the truth
about your father's death, right?

05:50.250 --> 05:52.590
Can you tell me what happened?

05:54.420 --> 05:59.430
While I was busy taking a piss,
the Interior Police got my old man.

06:00.550 --> 06:05.889
A tall guy wearing a black coat...
he killed my father.

06:05.890 --> 06:08.599
In any case, it's great
that you're still alive.

06:08.600 --> 06:10.599
Now we can make the truth public.

06:10.600 --> 06:14.149
How's that?! Haven't you seen the paper?!

06:14.150 --> 06:17.319
If the Military Police say the
Scouts did it, that's the truth!

06:17.320 --> 06:20.069
My testimony means jack shit!

06:20.070 --> 06:24.989
They know I was there... The Interior
Police found out I saw everything...

06:24.990 --> 06:27.949
Now there's nowhere safe for me to go.

06:27.950 --> 06:31.749
All I can do is run and hide
in these cramped walls...

06:31.750 --> 06:35.879
My life is... shit!

06:35.880 --> 06:38.379
Well, you have a point...

06:38.380 --> 06:42.180
The thing is, that doesn't
sound like living to me.

06:43.470 --> 06:46.099
Look at it this way, Flegel.

06:46.100 --> 06:50.269
Instead of scampering around like
a scared little mouse your whole life,

06:50.270 --> 06:54.019
wouldn't you rather face up to your enemy,
even if it means risking your life...?

06:54.020 --> 06:56.069
Like hell I would!

06:56.070 --> 06:59.689
Not everyone has the same disregard
for their lives as you do!

06:59.690 --> 07:03.279
Not only that, but you have
no right to criticize me either!

07:03.280 --> 07:06.829
Don't you care about telling your
company and family the truth?!

07:06.830 --> 07:09.079
Huh?! That's just what's best for you!

07:09.080 --> 07:10.869
Of course it is!

07:10.870 --> 07:13.459
You oughta start thinking
what's best for you, too!

07:13.460 --> 07:16.289
Who's that?! Who's making
a scene on my roof?!

07:16.290 --> 07:18.669
Now then, you're coming with me, Flegel.

07:18.670 --> 07:22.219
Hell no! Your gang already lost!

07:22.220 --> 07:24.299
You've been defeated!

07:24.300 --> 07:26.009
What are you talking about?

07:26.010 --> 07:29.560
Defeat is all the Scout
Regiment has ever known!

07:31.850 --> 07:34.729
Disguise as Military Police
to get by the guards...

07:34.730 --> 07:38.519
Then figure out where Eren
was taken by snooping around.

07:38.520 --> 07:41.689
To think we'd have no better option...

07:41.690 --> 07:46.659
We just don't have time...
We've got no choice but to do or die.

07:46.660 --> 07:47.780
Captain.

07:49.120 --> 07:50.789
Now then...

07:50.790 --> 07:53.499
Stohess District Military Police.

07:53.500 --> 07:56.209
Private Marlo Freudenberg.

07:56.210 --> 07:59.039
Captain Levi! It's really him!

07:59.040 --> 08:02.379
Same assignment, Private Hitch Dreyse.

08:02.380 --> 08:04.470
As for how we'll dispose of you...

08:05.800 --> 08:11.219
Because of you guys, over 100 people
from Stohess District were killed!

08:11.220 --> 08:12.349
Huh?

08:12.350 --> 08:13.180
Hey!

08:13.181 --> 08:17.689
You people... You might think
that you're all heroes of justice,

08:17.690 --> 08:21.899
but the victims and their families
were dropped straight into hell!

08:21.900 --> 08:24.110
Yeah, I know.

08:25.780 --> 08:30.079
You there... You're from the
Southern Cadet Corps, yeah?

08:30.080 --> 08:32.619
Just like Annie Leonhart.

08:32.620 --> 08:35.329
Were you friends of hers?

08:35.330 --> 08:41.299
No... I doubt she had any friends.
Being as gloomy and aloof as she was.

08:41.300 --> 08:44.920
It's like she was a kid
afraid of other people...

08:45.880 --> 08:49.349
I never got the chance to
know anything about her.

08:49.350 --> 08:52.469
And the reason they still
haven't found her...

08:52.470 --> 08:56.309
...is because she was pulverized
by a Titan into a puddle of jelly!

08:56.310 --> 08:57.769
No...

08:57.770 --> 09:02.650
Because the Titan in hiding was...
Annie Leonhart herself.

09:03.900 --> 09:07.149
Goddammit, it makes me sick.

09:07.150 --> 09:12.119
Nobody knows a damn thing about
this world... Not us or anyone else.

09:12.120 --> 09:16.289
Except for those bastards
at the center of it all.

09:16.290 --> 09:20.500
We'll release you both
as soon as we get out of here.

09:23.090 --> 09:25.129
Annie was...

09:25.130 --> 09:28.879
Captain Levi! Please let me help you!

09:28.880 --> 09:32.099
I don't think what you
guys are doing is wrong!

09:32.100 --> 09:37.769
If I can help correct this world's
injustice, I'll do whatever it takes!

09:37.770 --> 09:40.100
What's with this guy?

09:41.400 --> 09:43.319
I beg of you, Captain Levi!

09:43.320 --> 09:44.569
Not a chance.

09:44.570 --> 09:49.319
I can't tell how prepared you are about
making an enemy of the government.

09:49.320 --> 09:50.739
Let's go.

09:50.740 --> 09:53.739
Sasha. Tie them up somewhere nearby.

09:53.740 --> 09:54.740
Yes, sir!

09:58.040 --> 09:59.170
Captain.

10:00.170 --> 10:02.380
Please let me do it.

10:06.260 --> 10:07.720
Knock yourself out.

10:15.810 --> 10:17.020
Stop.

10:20.440 --> 10:23.109
We'll forget what we saw here.

10:23.110 --> 10:26.939
Yeah, you will! Because both
of you will die here!

10:26.940 --> 10:28.239
That's not what he said!

10:28.240 --> 10:30.989
Letting you two run free is too dangerous.

10:30.990 --> 10:33.489
I'll take it upon myself to kill you!

10:33.490 --> 10:35.079
Please, believe us!

10:35.080 --> 10:38.789
We know you guys are fighting
to try and save humanity!

10:38.790 --> 10:39.750
Right, Hitch?!

10:39.750 --> 10:40.580
Mmm, mmm!

10:40.581 --> 10:45.379
As if I could trust you.
Especially you, Mr. Bowl Cut.

10:45.380 --> 10:48.299
Who in their right mind
would cut their hair like that?

10:48.300 --> 10:51.220
You'll get no sympathy from this guy!

10:55.550 --> 10:57.220
Hitch, run!

11:00.020 --> 11:02.059
My gun is faster, you know.

11:02.060 --> 11:04.189
Wanna take your chances?

11:04.190 --> 11:07.319
Your knife and my gun... Let's race!

11:07.320 --> 11:09.899
Wait! I'm really your ally!

11:09.900 --> 11:13.109
Why the hell would anyone
believe you'd wanna join us?

11:13.110 --> 11:18.120
We're so severely outmatched,
you really think we can save humanity?

11:19.200 --> 11:21.909
Then, why are you...?

11:21.910 --> 11:25.040
Why are you still with the Scouts then?

11:26.960 --> 11:30.339
I picked the wrong regiment to join.

11:30.340 --> 11:34.679
As long as you guys have it in you
to risk your lives and keep fighting...

11:34.680 --> 11:36.640
...I will trust you.

11:42.270 --> 11:44.189
Hitch!

11:44.190 --> 11:45.559
You damn horse face!

11:45.560 --> 11:49.689
Wait, Hitch! He was just testing us!

11:49.690 --> 11:51.280
Huh?!

11:53.070 --> 11:54.949
Hey, you.

11:54.950 --> 11:59.699
What would you have done
if I swung the knife at you?

11:59.700 --> 12:02.250
Why did you trust me so much?

12:03.370 --> 12:07.329
Somehow or another,
you remind me of a guy that I hate.

12:07.330 --> 12:09.000
A damn idiot.

12:10.210 --> 12:14.380
This idiot... Is it the same
one Annie talked about?

12:16.090 --> 12:17.759
Hell if I know.

12:17.760 --> 12:19.510
Everyone's an idiot.

12:24.310 --> 12:27.349
Fortunately, we're both just as dumb.

12:27.350 --> 12:30.940
Marlo, I think you proved your dedication.

12:32.440 --> 12:35.949
That should be enough
to convince Captain Levi.

12:35.950 --> 12:38.280
We're counting on you.

12:41.870 --> 12:45.459
That over there is the least
manned checkpoint around.

12:45.460 --> 12:48.459
All right. We'll handle it ourselves.

12:48.460 --> 12:51.499
Get back to your squad
before it's suspicious.

12:51.500 --> 12:52.710
Yes, sir.

12:54.630 --> 12:56.300
Marlo, Hitch.

12:57.640 --> 12:59.050
We're grateful.

13:00.510 --> 13:02.429
Sir!

13:02.430 --> 13:03.719
Let's go!

13:03.720 --> 13:05.940
It's our turn to pick a fight!

13:10.060 --> 13:11.190
Hmm?

13:30.330 --> 13:31.540
It's me.

13:34.460 --> 13:36.589
Captain, he's...

13:36.590 --> 13:38.719
With the Interior Police.

13:38.720 --> 13:41.679
I've got a few questions for him.

13:41.680 --> 13:42.970
Let's move.

14:01.700 --> 14:07.459
How dumb can you be?
Running into a deserted dump like this...

14:07.460 --> 14:09.539
Shit!

14:09.540 --> 14:13.169
But I owe you one, Flegel Reeves.

14:13.170 --> 14:17.549
When you got away and
gave us the slip, I really...

14:17.550 --> 14:22.010
I thought I was screwed!

14:26.890 --> 14:30.730
For a minute there, I
thought they'd kill me.

14:31.940 --> 14:35.519
Nice knowing you, Flegel. Thanks a bunch!

14:35.520 --> 14:37.279
Ah, wait!

14:37.280 --> 14:39.149
Why was my old man killed?!

14:39.150 --> 14:40.989
Did the Interior Police do it?!

14:40.990 --> 14:43.699
Huh? What does it matter to you?

14:43.700 --> 14:47.199
You're about to be fresh corpse.

14:47.200 --> 14:49.789
I-I wanna know before I die!

14:49.790 --> 14:52.499
What did he ever do to
deserve being killed?!

14:52.500 --> 14:54.749
Eh? You don't know?

14:54.750 --> 14:59.469
He betrayed us and sided
with those damn Scouts.

14:59.470 --> 15:00.759
Betrayed?

15:00.760 --> 15:05.099
So you're saying it was the Interior
Police that made him kidnap those Scouts?!

15:05.100 --> 15:07.929
Except it was a different squad than us.

15:07.930 --> 15:10.769
Guess he didn't say a damn thing.

15:10.770 --> 15:13.939
Not to his dimwit son.

15:13.940 --> 15:16.569
And what if he would've refused?

15:16.570 --> 15:21.739
Well, he'd have known a bit too much,
so he would've had to die.

15:21.740 --> 15:23.699
What a fool.

15:23.700 --> 15:27.410
Look where caring for the city
and workers got 'em.

15:29.370 --> 15:32.409
You would never understand.

15:32.410 --> 15:33.619
Hmm?

15:33.620 --> 15:36.749
Talking like you're smart shit...

15:36.750 --> 15:39.379
My old man taught me something.

15:39.380 --> 15:42.839
That merchants gotta follow their nose.

15:42.840 --> 15:45.179
And I'm damn glad that I did.

15:45.180 --> 15:48.219
Because I found the people
who could avenge my old man!

15:48.220 --> 15:49.719
And I side with them!

15:49.720 --> 15:53.809
What's the matter, Flegel? Go on and
oink like a pig to be slaughtered!

15:53.810 --> 15:56.559
You had your time, but it's over!

15:56.560 --> 15:58.770
Look above you, morons!

16:12.250 --> 16:13.909
Ouch!

16:13.910 --> 16:16.459
Section Commander! You're too wild!

16:16.460 --> 16:20.089
Hell yeah! Did you hear that, everyone?!

16:20.090 --> 16:25.090
The... Scout Regiment...? Why?

16:28.220 --> 16:30.469
Not so deserted, eh?

16:30.470 --> 16:32.769
Perhaps it looks that way to you.

16:32.770 --> 16:34.189
But, sorry.

16:34.190 --> 16:38.309
I know it doesn't look like much,
but we still live here.

16:38.310 --> 16:40.069
We heard everything.

16:40.070 --> 16:45.359
The Interior Police and their schemes...
Everyone here is a witness.

16:45.360 --> 16:47.949
S-So, what does it matter?

16:47.950 --> 16:50.989
It's the government that
decides what's the truth!

16:50.990 --> 16:55.039
You fools... Don't think you can
do this and get away with it!

16:55.040 --> 16:57.669
You're all in for a world of hu...

16:57.670 --> 17:00.749
Everyone... Don't worry.

17:00.750 --> 17:03.709
The Reeves Company will protect this city.

17:03.710 --> 17:06.429
As of today, I, Flegel Reeves...

17:06.430 --> 17:08.180
I'm the boss.

17:09.680 --> 17:16.390
So... from now... you can count... on me.

17:20.650 --> 17:22.689
We're counting on you, Boss.

17:22.690 --> 17:24.689
Speak up, man!

17:24.690 --> 17:26.569
Congrats on the job.

17:26.570 --> 17:29.529
Keep an eye on these Interior Police.

17:29.530 --> 17:30.780
Right.

17:35.200 --> 17:37.330
Stop it...

17:41.340 --> 17:43.750
Where are Eren and Christa?

17:45.170 --> 17:46.799
Oh, you're so brave.

17:46.800 --> 17:48.923
That checkpoint back
there was just recruits

17:48.948 --> 17:51.599
who could barely
wipe their own ass.

17:51.600 --> 17:55.849
You think you're some sort of hero,
beating them down?

17:55.850 --> 17:58.640
What an atrocious thing we've done.

18:01.150 --> 18:04.529
But what's more atrocious
is this mouth of yours.

18:04.530 --> 18:08.859
I recommend you start talking
while you're still able to use it.

18:08.860 --> 18:11.320
Where are Eren and Christa?

18:14.290 --> 18:16.409
It's no use!

18:16.410 --> 18:18.409
All that's left for you now is

18:18.434 --> 18:22.919
to run and hide inside these
walls, covered in mud and shit!

18:22.920 --> 18:28.009
If you don't turn yourselves in, every
last Scout we captured will get the noose!

18:28.010 --> 18:32.390
Starting with the one most
guilty of all, Erwin Smith!

18:35.510 --> 18:37.059
Shut up.

18:37.060 --> 18:40.189
That's for not answering my question.

18:40.190 --> 18:43.519
Some Scouts' lives are
more valuable than others.

18:43.520 --> 18:47.779
Only those dumb enough
to acknowledge that join us.

18:47.780 --> 18:50.199
Tell me where Eren and Christa are at.

18:50.200 --> 18:51.949
I-I don't know!

18:51.950 --> 18:53.989
I'm not allowed to know!

18:53.990 --> 18:56.909
Kenny Ackermann is a very cautious man!

18:56.910 --> 18:58.999
Ackermann?

18:59.000 --> 19:01.959
I know Kenny... Is that his last name?

19:01.960 --> 19:03.710
It is, but...

19:05.250 --> 19:10.719
True, there's a lot of things he doesn't
divulge... Especially the important stuff.

19:10.720 --> 19:13.089
But you must have a rough idea.

19:13.090 --> 19:15.179
You best try to remember.

19:15.180 --> 19:15.760
...Stop it!

19:15.760 --> 19:16.430
...You still have plenty of bones
left to break. ...Stop it!

19:16.431 --> 19:19.679
...You still have plenty
of bones left to break.

19:19.680 --> 19:23.149
You... You're insane!

19:23.150 --> 19:24.859
Maybe I am.

19:24.860 --> 19:26.650
Someone's coming from that way!

19:29.190 --> 19:30.610
More than one!

19:32.200 --> 19:34.489
Told you so, Captain.

19:34.490 --> 19:37.029
It's no use.

19:37.030 --> 19:42.160
One way or another, the Scouts
will soon come to an end!

19:49.460 --> 19:52.379
I've seen you in better shape.

19:52.380 --> 19:56.220
And to think you were
lecturing me the other day.

20:00.310 --> 20:02.389
You're getting an audience with the King.

20:02.390 --> 20:07.569
They'll decide how to dismantle the Scouts
and announce your final sentence.

20:07.570 --> 20:09.320
Nile, huh?

20:11.360 --> 20:13.569
Where was your house?

20:13.570 --> 20:15.660
Stohess District, was it?

20:17.200 --> 20:23.290
Is Marie...? Is your family doing well?

20:25.120 --> 20:29.339
They're doing fine. Both
Marie and the kids.

20:29.340 --> 20:32.259
I haven't been home in a while, but...

20:32.260 --> 20:35.050
...it's around Eastern Wall Rose.

20:36.180 --> 20:37.890
I see...

20:39.260 --> 20:42.140
What's with the odd questions?

20:43.100 --> 20:47.099
I entrusted something to Commander Pyxis.

20:47.100 --> 20:49.940
When, and if the time comes...

20:51.570 --> 20:54.699
When it comes, I will only watch.

20:54.700 --> 20:59.410
It's up to you to decide. You... and them.

21:04.460 --> 21:08.539
So, I take it not much
came out of Erwin in the end.

21:08.540 --> 21:13.259
Indeed... He must not have learned
any secrets from Pastor Nick.

21:13.260 --> 21:17.006
Historia Reiss can make all the
claims she wants about her name,

21:17.031 --> 21:19.049
but they'll amount to nothing.

21:19.050 --> 21:20.349
How silly.

21:20.350 --> 21:24.599
In any case, they're all nothing
more than birds in a cage.

21:24.600 --> 21:26.770
Just waiting to die...

21:28.650 --> 21:30.019
Excuse me.

21:30.020 --> 21:32.569
Erwin Smith has arrived.

21:32.570 --> 21:35.989
Very well. We're coming.

21:35.990 --> 21:41.079
Once we finally execute him,
all will be according to plan.

21:41.080 --> 21:45.079
And just like they always have,
the wall's secrets will stay safe.

21:45.080 --> 21:47.830
We'll protect the peace within the walls.

21:49.330 --> 21:51.040
Forever...

21:59.220 --> 22:00.799
Erwin.

22:00.800 --> 22:03.890
Do you have any last words?

23:40.400 --> 23:42.989
In order to protect the kingdom...

23:42.990 --> 23:47.659
In order to protect the King,
